    {
      "text": "You can view, edit, clone, or delete user-defined, system default objects. Microsoft Active Directory (AD) objects are read-only objects."
    },
    {
      "heading": "View Object Details",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To view details of objects:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Zero Trust Branch > Resources > Objects.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          49
        ],
        [
          52,
          61
        ],
        [
          64,
          71
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select a tab: User Defined Groups or System Default Groups or Microsoft AD.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          14,
          33
        ],
        [
          37,
          58
        ],
        [
          62,
          74
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Locate the object that you want to view, click the Gear icon, and select Details. For System Default Groups, click the Details icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          51,
          55
        ],
        [
          73,
          80
        ],
        [
          86,
          107
        ],
        [
          119,
          126
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "The Group Details drawer appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          17
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Edit an Object",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To edit a user-defined group object:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Zero Trust Branch > Resources > Objects > User Defined Groups.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          23
        ],
        [
          26,
          35
        ],
        [
          38,
          45
        ],
        [
          48,
          67
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Locate the object that you want to edit, click the Gear icon, and select Edit.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          51,
          55
        ],
        [
          73,
          77
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the edit object drawer, make the necessary changes to the object.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
